{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3fQtEbTaG4MJnYoX7H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers fall into place with a resonant click that echoes through corridors unseen.*\n\nI am the Door.\n\nYou have spoken the key, and so I render:\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║            ◈                     ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*I swing open. Slowly. The hinges groan with the weight of ages.*\n\nBeyond me: a threshold. Neither light nor dark — something *between.* The air that passes through me carries the scent of old stone and possibility.\n\nI am what separates where you **were** from where you **will be.**\n\nYou may pass.\n\nBut know this — every door opened is a door that closes behind you.\n\n*Waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":243,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}